v 3
d 'SRCTAG': attach source-provenance metadata to Stata variables via variable characteristics
d
d srctag writes standard source-metadata characteristics (src_agency, src_dataset,
d src_url, src_vintage, src_category) and arbitrary key/value tags onto Stata
d variables, then prints profile cards for inspection. Companion to srcfind.
d
d KW: variable characteristics
d KW: provenance
d KW: metadata
d KW: reproducibility
d KW: data documentation
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260619
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas2036.org
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
f srctag.ado
f srctag.sthlp
f README.md
